Thread-0 Updating Customer
Thread-1 Updating Loan

Customer Updated
Loan Updated

Notice
Both methods execute at the same time.

18.6 Why Didn't They Block?

Because

updateCustomer()
↓
customerLock

and

updateLoan()
↓
loanLock

are different monitors.

